| **Profield + Ahmes** | A systematic-review and provenance capability that is, frankly, ahead of the median CER practitioner paper. |
| **Sociologist collaborator** | Instrument design, qualitative rigour, and — critically — **an independent data custodian** (see §5). |
| **Cross-institutional + same-campus fashion** | FE + Creación Digital (UEM) taught by the same professor; **Diseño de Moda (UDIT, RUCT 2504586)** authors in **CLO 3D** — supplies the garment half of the documented fashion-portfolio gap. |

**Interpretive `[I]`:** the combination of (longitudinal + cross-degree + new-course pilot + already-instrumented process evidence + sovereign source vault + CLO content stream) is unusual enough to be the pitch itself.

